@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin/Teknisi" as Admin
boundary "Halaman Hotspot" as UI
control "Sistem (Backend)" as System
database "Database(hotspot_users, profiles, logs)" as DB
participant "MikroTik Router" as MT

' ================= FLOW 1: GENERATE VOUCHER =================
group Generate Voucher Hotspot
    Admin -> UI : 1. Input jumlah & pilih Hotspot Profile
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 2. POST /api/hotspot/generate {qty, profile_id}
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> DB : 3. GET profile parameters (speed, validity, price)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 4. Return profile data
    deactivate DB

    System -> System : 5. Loop: Generate username/pass & hitung expired date
    System -> DB : 6. INSERT batch ke tabel hotspot_users
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 7. Return generated IDs
    deactivate DB

    System -> DB : 8. INSERT ke laporan_penjualan (log transaksi)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 9. Log tersimpan
    deactivate DB

    System -> MT : 10. API: /ip/hotspot/user/add (batch insert)
    activate MT
    MT --> System : 11. Return success/fail count
    deactivate MT

    System --> UI : 12. Return {success: true, vouchers: [...]}
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : 13. Tampilkan daftar voucher siap cetak
    deactivate UI
end

' ================= FLOW 2: CETAK VOUCHER =================
group Cetak Voucher
    Admin -> UI : 14. Pilih voucher & klik "Cetak"
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 15. GET /api/hotspot/vouchers/{id}/print
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> DB : 16. Query detail voucher & profile
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 17. Return formatted data
    deactivate DB

    System -> System : 18. Generate template PDF/HTML
    System --> UI : 19. Return file stream / download URL
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : 20. Download & Print Voucher
    deactivate UI
end

' ================= FLOW 3: MONITORING ACTIVE SESSION =================
group Monitoring Active & Update Status
    Admin -> UI : 21. Refresh / Buka Dashboard Hotspot
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 22. GET /api/hotspot/active-sessions
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> MT : 23. API: /ip/hotspot/active/print
    activate MT
    MT --> System : 24. Return list active users (IP, MAC, Uptime)
    deactivate MT

    System -> System : 25. Match active sessions with DB hotspot_users
    System -> DB : 26. UPDATE status='online', last_seen=NOW()
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 27. Update berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System -> DB : 28. UPDATE rekap laporan (voucher used count)
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 29. Update berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : 30. Return {active_users: [...], stats: {...}}
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : 31. Tampilkan user online & statistik real-time
    deactivate UI
end

note right of Admin
  * Voucher sync: DB <-> MikroTik /ip/hotspot/user
  * Active monitoring: MikroTik /ip/hotspot/active -> System -> DB
  * Laporan penjualan otomatis tercatat saat generate
end note
@enduml